    "about_tagline": "A film platform, built by filmmakers, for filmmakers.",
    "about_body_1": "Kinoplatform brings together film industry professionals, actors, and creative and technical talent on a single platform. Our goal is to open new horizons for building professional connections, forming creative partnerships, and bringing bold film projects to life.",
    "about_body_2": "The platform helps newcomers get noticed and lets experienced professionals quickly find their next collaborators. Here you can explore the professional pages of actors and filmmakers and get to know their experience, filmography, and journey.",
    "about_body_3": "Kinoplatform's vision reaches beyond Armenia: we aim to build bridges between film producers from different countries. Soon our users will be able to present their work to partners abroad and take part in international projects.",
    "about_body_4": "Step by step, we are building an accessible, effective, and modern environment that supports the growth of the local film industry and its international recognition.",
